    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mongolian Death Worm. It is the ultimate UMA, with a perfect balance of form, ecology, and name. I arrived in the land of Mongolia to capture the Mongolian Death Worm.  However, Mongolia has turned into a magical city with an army and an infestation of UMAs!  To capture my beloved Mongolian Death Worm and save our Mongolian Death Worm Capture Department from extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Now, the battle for the survival of the planet begins. \u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Game Introduction\u25c6 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis is a text adventure in the form of a visual novel game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThere is no branching by choices, and there is one ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThe estimated playing time is about 1 hour.</p>",
